msgstr "Composite (`ketu.composite`)"

#: ../../source/api.md:529
msgid "Midpoint composite chart computation. New in v1.2."
msgstr "Calcul du thème composite par point médian. Nouveau en v1.2."

#: ../../source/api.md:535
msgid "`circular_midpoint(lon_a, lon_b)`"
msgstr "`circular_midpoint(lon_a, lon_b)`"

#: ../../source/api.md:537
msgid "Compute the circular (shortest-arc) midpoint between two longitudes."
msgstr ""
"Calcule le point médian circulaire (arc le plus court) entre deux "
"longitudes."

#: ../../source/api.md:539
msgid ""
"**Parameters:** `lon_a`, `lon_b` (`float` or array): ecliptic longitudes "
"in degrees"
msgstr ""
"**Paramètres :** `lon_a`, `lon_b` (`float` ou tableau) : longitudes "
"écliptiques en degrés"

#: ../../source/api.md:541
msgid "**Returns:** `float` or array"
msgstr "**Retourne :** `float` ou tableau"

#: ../../source/api.md:549
msgid "`calculate_composite(chart_a, chart_b, system=\"placidus\")`"
msgstr "`calculate_composite(chart_a, chart_b, system=\"placidus\")`"

#: ../../source/api.md:551
msgid ""
"Build a composite (midpoint) chart from two natal `CHART_DTYPE` arrays. "
"The result is a new `CHART_DTYPE` array where each body position is the "
"circular midpoint of the corresponding bodies in chart A and B."
msgstr ""
"Construit un thème composite (point médian) à partir de deux tableaux "
"`CHART_DTYPE` natals. Le résultat est un nouveau tableau `CHART_DTYPE` où"
" chaque position de corps est le point médian circulaire des corps "
"correspondants dans les thèmes A et B."

#: ../../source/api.md:570
msgid "Returns (`ketu.returns`)"
msgstr "Retours (`ketu.returns`)"

#: ../../source/api.md:572
msgid "Solar and lunar return charts. New in v1.2."
msgstr "Thèmes de retour solaire et lunaire. Nouveau en v1.2."

#: ../../source/api.md:578
msgid ""
"**Key asymmetry:** `solar_return` takes `target_year` as an `int`; "
"`lunar_return` takes `target_jd` as a `float`."
msgstr ""
"**Asymétrie clé :** `solar_return` prend `target_year` comme `int` ; "
"`lunar_return` prend `target_jd` comme `float`."

#: ../../source/api.md:580
msgid ""
"`solar_return(natal_jd, natal_lat, natal_lon, target_year, "
"return_lat=None, return_lon=None, system=\"placidus\")`"
msgstr ""
"`solar_return(natal_jd, natal_lat, natal_lon, target_year, "
"return_lat=None, return_lon=None, system=\"placidus\")`"

#: ../../source/api.md:582
msgid ""
"Find the exact Julian Day when the Sun returns to its natal longitude "
"during `target_year`, then build the full chart at that moment."
msgstr ""
"Trouve le Jour Julien exact où le Soleil retourne à sa longitude natale "
"pendant `target_year`, puis construit le thème complet à cet instant."

#: ../../source/api.md:585 ../../source/api.md:606
msgid "`natal_jd` (`float`): Julian Day of birth"
msgstr "`natal_jd` (`float`) : Jour Julien de naissance"

#: ../../source/api.md:586 ../../source/api.md:607
msgid "`natal_lat`, `natal_lon` (`float`): birth geographic coordinates"
msgstr ""
"`natal_lat`, `natal_lon` (`float`) : coordonnées géographiques de "
"naissance"

#: ../../source/api.md:587
msgid "`target_year` (`int`): Gregorian year for the return"
msgstr "`target_year` (`int`) : année grégorienne pour le retour"

#: ../../source/api.md:588
msgid ""
"`return_lat`, `return_lon` (`float`, optional): relocated return "
"location; `None` → natal location"
msgstr ""
"`return_lat`, `return_lon` (`float`, optionnel) : lieu de retour "
"relocalisé ; `None` → lieu natal"

#: ../../source/api.md:591
msgid "**Returns:** scalar `CHART_DTYPE` array for the return chart"
msgstr "**Retourne :** tableau `CHART_DTYPE` scalaire pour le thème de retour"

#: ../../source/api.md:601
msgid ""
"`lunar_return(natal_jd, natal_lat, natal_lon, target_jd, return_lat=None,"
" return_lon=None, system=\"placidus\")`"
msgstr ""
"`lunar_return(natal_jd, natal_lat, natal_lon, target_jd, return_lat=None,"
" return_lon=None, system=\"placidus\")`"

#: ../../source/api.md:603
msgid ""
"Find the next lunar return on or after `target_jd` (Moon returns to natal"
" longitude), then build the chart."
msgstr ""
"Trouve le prochain retour lunaire à partir de `target_jd` (la Lune "
"retourne à sa longitude natale), puis construit le thème."

#: ../../source/api.md:608
msgid "`target_jd` (`float`): search starts from this Julian Day"
msgstr "`target_jd` (`float`) : la recherche commence à partir de ce Jour Julien"

#: ../../source/api.md:609
msgid "`return_lat`, `return_lon` (`float`, optional): relocated location"
msgstr "`return_lat`, `return_lon` (`float`, optionnel) : lieu relocalisé"

#: ../../source/api.md:612
msgid "**Returns:** scalar `CHART_DTYPE` array"
msgstr "**Retourne :** tableau `CHART_DTYPE` scalaire"

